{"id":"ccbc11:problem:23","answer":"COLORADO SPRUCE","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"关于第一步要做的事","html":"<p>尝试着组词试试看</p>","text":"尝试着组词试试看","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[{"answer":"科罗拉多云杉","messageHtml":"<p>请提交英文答案（8 6）。</p>","messageText":"请提交英文答案（8 6）。","extraHtml":"","extraText":"","assetIds":[]}],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>组词题，需要补充三字词语的中间的字。按照树杈结构逐层向上组词：</p>\n<p><img alt=\"结果\" data-asset-id=\"asset-b6352bfe1a5c18cc2ec8b1f3\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc11/images/answer/answer23.png\"/></p>\n<p>取树干的字：科罗拉多云杉。根据题目下方单词长度的提示进行翻译，答案是：<strong>COLORADO SPRUCE</strong>。</p>","text":"组词题，需要补充三字词语的中间的字。按照树杈结构逐层向上组词：\n\n取树干的字：科罗拉多云杉。根据题目下方单词长度的提示进行翻译，答案是：\nCOLORADO SPRUCE\n。","refId":null,"assetIds":["asset-b6352bfe1a5c18cc2ec8b1f3"]},"extended":{"html":"","text":"","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{},"sourceMetadata":{"type":"problem"},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-b6352bfe1a5c18cc2ec8b1f3","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc11/images/answer/answer23.png","path":"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc11/images/answer/answer23.png","mime":"image/png","size":1435160,"sha256":"314eb05033f4d8432cf924dd9c1bd94520ddf1ccc8f4e52185bdebd0afe36579","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]}]}
